                  <name>ForceInactive</name>
                  <description>OCyREF is forced low / CombinedPwmMode1: OCyREF has the same behavior as in PWM mode 1. OCyREFC is the logical OR between OC1REF and OC2REF</description>
                  <value>4</value>
                </enumeratedValue>
                <enumeratedValue>
